{"assets":["/statement-assets/812173b2fd070765b4e1c9dbcdb2256b69432ccda05177a566279af55ac91708.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"528","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Fuzzy Search"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Leonid works for a small and promising start-up that works on decoding the human genome. His duties include solving complex problems of finding certain patterns in long strings consisting of letters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's consider the following scenario. There is a fragment of a human DNA chain, recorded as a string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":". To analyze the fragment, you need to find all occurrences of string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" in a string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":". However, the matter is complicated by the fact that the original chain fragment could contain minor mutations, which, however, complicate the task of finding a fragment. Leonid proposed the following approach to solve this problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's write down integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k ≥ 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the error threshold. We will say that string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" occurs in string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":" on position "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ |S| - |T| + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"), if after putting string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" along with this position, each character of string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" corresponds to the some character of the same value in string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":" at the distance of at most "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". More formally, for any "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ j ≤ |T|"},{"kind":"text","text":") there must exist such "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ p ≤ |S|"},{"kind":"text","text":"), that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|(i + j - 1) - p| ≤ k"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S[p] = T[j]"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, corresponding to the given definition, string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ACAT"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" occurs in string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"AGCAATTCAT"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" in positions "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/812173b2fd070765b4e1c9dbcdb2256b69432ccda05177a566279af55ac91708.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that at "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" the given definition transforms to a simple definition of the occurrence of a string in a string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Leonid by calculating in how many positions the given string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" occurs in the given string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":" with the given error threshold."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|S|, |T|, k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ |T| ≤ |S| ≤ 200 000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ k ≤ 200 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the lengths of strings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the error threshold."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Both strings consist only of uppercase letters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single number — the number of occurrences of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":" with the error threshold "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" by the given definition."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10 4 1\nAGCAATTCAT\nACAT\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If you happen to know about the structure of the human genome a little more than the author of the problem, and you are not impressed with Leonid's original approach, do not take everything described above seriously."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"528D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/528/problem/D"}